A purple worm pet sure is helpful. But if the food issue makes you worry
(it _is_ a potential problem) and you don't want to spend another charge
of your wand, the thing to do with polytraps and pets is using a magic
whistle. It's far more effective than just waiting, and I don't think a
leash is any help. Try to find one of those, stand beside the trap and
keep blowing it. Be sure not to step into the trap yourself without MR,
or it'll vanish.

